  "normalize": false,
  "sentence_method": "one complete sentence per generation",
  "word_method": "independent word generation, not extracted from sentence audio",
  "sentences": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "text": "China has named the nation's first Mars rover Zhu Rong.",
      "file": "assets/audio/sentences/sentence-01.mp3",
      "exists": true
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "For all of us, Zhu Rong is a well-suited name that has a cultural meaning within Chinese history.",
      "file": "assets/audio/sentences/sentence-02.mp3",
      "exists": true
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "In an ancient Chinese story, Zhu Rong had the face of a man and the body of an animal.",
      "file": "assets/audio/sentences/sentence-03.mp3",
      "exists": true
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "He rode on two dragons.",
      "file": "assets/audio/sentences/sentence-04.mp3",
      "exists": true
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "When he had a big fight with Gong Gong, the god of water, Zhu Rong won.",
      "file": "assets/audio/sentences/sentence-05.mp3",
      "exists": true
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "text": "But after the fight, the human world came into complete darkness.",
      "file": "assets/audio/sentences/sentence-06.mp3",
      "exists": true
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "text": "Then he brought fire from heaven to the world, becoming a great hero.",
      "file": "assets/audio/sentences/sentence-07.mp3",
      "exists": true
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "text": "Much like the stories of kung fu heroes who travel far and face many dangers, the Mars rover went on its own adventures.",
      "file": "assets/audio/sentences/sentence-08.mp3",
      "exists": true
    },
    {
      "id": 9,
      "text": "\"Zhu Rong is regarded as the earliest god of fire in traditional Chinese culture,\" a space official said.",
      "file": "assets/audio/sentences/sentence-09.mp3",
      "exists": true
    },
    {
      "id": 10,
      "text": "\"The first Mars rover was named Zhu Rong.",
      "file": "assets/audio/sentences/sentence-10.mp3",
      "exists": true
    },
    {
      "id": 11,
      "text": "The name symbolises light and hope for space exploration in our country, and means to guide humans to continue exploring somewhere we've never been before.\"",
      "file": "assets/audio/sentences/sentence-11.mp3",
      "exists": true
    },
    {
      "id": 12,
      "text": "Aboard a powerful rocket, Zhu Rong left the Earth, circled Mars for several months and landed on it.",
      "file": "assets/audio/sentences/sentence-12.mp3",
      "exists": true
    },
    {
      "id": 13,
      "text": "Zhu Rong is like a postman in the universe, having sent back many important messages from Mars.",
      "file": "assets/audio/sentences/sentence-13.mp3",
      "exists": true
    },
    {
      "id": 14,
      "text": "In recent years, our country has sent up the world's first quantum satellite and Chang'e-5 has made a soft landing on the moon.",
      "file": "assets/audio/sentences/sentence-14.mp3",
      "exists": true
    },
    {
      "id": 15,
      "text": "Zhu Rong is another key step in our space technology achievements.",
      "file": "assets/audio/sentences/sentence-15.mp3",
      "exists": true
    },
    {
      "id": 16,
      "text": "We have made great progress in space technology and have built our own space station, which fills us with great pride.",
      "file": "assets/audio/sentences/sentence-16.mp3",
      "exists": true
    }
  ],
